      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Linked list - fast/slow</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/linked-list-cycle/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 141</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Linked List Cycle</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Run two pointers, one step and two steps per round. Without a loop the fast one falls off the end; with a loop it gains exactly one node per round on the slow one, so it can never jump over it and must land on it. O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
